  },
  {
   "start": 85.1,
   "end": 103.4,
   "title": "I'm Forgetting Something...",
   "quote": "I think I'm forgetting something... / Oh dammit, the kid! That's right!!! / I don't have my tail! This fat bastard cut it off!!",
   "line_start": 26,
   "line_end": 33
  },
  {
   "start": 113.0,
   "end": 125.6,
   "title": "He's Gonna Save/Kill Us All",
   "quote": "Yay! Gohan's transformed! He's gonna save us all! / Oh no! Gohan's transformed! He's gonna kill us all!!",
   "line_start": 40,
   "line_end": 42
  },
  {
   "start": 143.8,
   "end": 156.3,
   "title": "OH THAT'S BULLS**T!",
   "quote": "OH THAT'S *BULLS**T*! I haven't killed a damned thing since I got to this godforsaken planet!",
   "line_start": 52,
   "line_end": 57
  },
  {
   "start": 158.1,
   "end": 184.24,
   "title": "I'm the Best... Around!",
   "quote": "FINE! I'll DO IT MYSELF THEN! / ♪ I'm the best... around! ♪ / No… NOOOOO!!!!",
   "line_start": 60,
   "line_end": 70
  },
  {
   "start": 201.5,
   "end": 221.0,
   "title": "Suck It, Spock!",
   "quote": "It looks more like an orbiting vessel, or a satell-- / …Suck it, Spock!",
   "line_start": 75,
   "line_end": 81
  },
  {
   "start": 262.2,
   "end": 292.6,
   "title": "Totally Sorry",
   "quote": "I'm sorry. Yep, *totally* sorry. I just feel terrible. ... That you're all still alive! SUCKERS!!",
   "line_start": 95,
   "line_end": 104
  },
  {
   "start": 292.5,
   "end": 326.0,
   "title": "A Cool One-Hundred Thou",
   "quote": "Many lives were lost, many lessons were learned, and I made out with a cool one-hundred thou! / You cheating son of a--! / Can't hear you, don't care!",
